BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Nutcracker by Rise City Dance — Atlanta
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261122T130000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261122T150000
DTSTAMP:20261123T235726Z
UID:42298d49a142f0508c579d9939b4@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Dance\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with Rise City Dance’s production of Th
 e Nutcracker\, a holiday tradition filled with music\, imagination and joy
 . Presented by Marisa Hammett Real Estate\, the production features more t
 han 125 youth performers from the Neighborhood Ballet and special guests. 
 The holiday ballet set to Tchaikovsky’s beloved score follows Clara from
  a festive Christmas Eve party through a battle with the Mouse King and in
 to the sparkling Land of Sweets. Choreography by Rise City Dance’s creat
 ive team brings the story to life with lively characters\, beautiful danci
 ng\, and moments of wonder. Gather family and friends for a holiday tradit
 ion presented in two acts with one intermission. Join the\nCategory: Dance
 \nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/the-nutcracker-by-rise-c
 ity-dance/2026-11-22/1/
LOCATION:Ferst Center for the Arts\, 349 Ferst Dr. N.W.\, Atlanta\, GA\, 3
