BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OpenLAB La mecánica de la verdad - Festival — Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261126T160000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261128T160000
DTSTAMP:20261123T235726Z
UID:7305beee473d82a5cddda5e9dcbc@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:A lo largo del año\, LAB 5 La mecánica de la verdad ha explo
 rado la producción tecnológica de lo real: cómo se ensamblan los hechos
 \, cómo se fabrica una creencia\, cómo la percepción está bajo presió
 n constante y cómo los modelos y las simulaciones pueden manipularla o ac
 udir en su rescate. El OpenLAB cierra este recorrido. Durante tres días d
 e charlas y presentaciones\, artistas\, tecnólogos\, diseñadores\, pensa
 dores y participantes del programa abordan esas cuestiones desde práctica
 s de investigación artística\, innovación popular y visiones alternativ
 as al mainstream comercial. Entre ellas se presentan los prototipos del La
 boratorio de Prototipado Colaborativo\, desarrollados por 25 participante
 \nCategory: Multidisciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadri
 d.org/en/schedule/lab-5-mechanics-truth
LOCATION:Nave Una\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/lab-5-mechanics-truth
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OpenLAB The Mechanics of Truth - Festival — Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261126T160000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261128T160000
DTSTAMP:20261123T235726Z
UID:22eb1104ff4c04f81f43d2689004@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:Over the course of the year\, LAB 5 The Mechanics of Truth has
  explored the technological production of the real: how facts are assemble
 d\, how beliefs are manufactured\, how perception is under constant pressu
 re\, and how models and simulations can manipulate it or come to its rescu
 e. OpenLAB brings it to a close. Across three days of talks and presentati
 ons\, artists\, technologists\, designers\, thinkers and programme partici
 pants take up these questions through artistic research practices\, grassr
 oots innovation and visions that run counter to the commercial mainstream.
  These include the prototypes from the Collaborative Prototyping Lab \, de
 veloped by 25 participants selected through an internati\nCategory: Multid
 isciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/
 openlab-mechanics-truth-festival
LOCATION:Nave Una\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/openlab-mechanics-truth-fes
 tival
