BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Como todo mortal — Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261126T190000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261126T190000
DTSTAMP:20261123T235726Z
UID:0b5157160c590bf97cad5ba6508d@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:En un planeta lejano\, un robot explora el paisaje en busca de
  minerales y señales de vida. A años luz\, en una de las minas más anti
 guas del mundo\, sus habitantes viven rodeados de pueblos sepultados bajo 
 toneladas de residuos minerales\, mientras unos astrobiólogos investigan 
 una biosfera oculta que plantea una inquietante hipótesis evolutiva. Entr
 etejiendo documental\, flamenco y ciencia ficción\, Como todo mortal exca
 va los estratos sociales\, históricos y especulativos de un paisaje entre
  la exploración y la explotación\, entre Andalucía y Marte. > Con la pr
 esencia de la directora.\nCategory: Multidisciplinary\nOriginal listing: h
 ttps://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/margenes-2026
LOCATION:Sala Azcona\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/margenes-2026
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OpenLAB 2026 | When the machine doubts - Talk by Júlia Nueno — 
 Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261126T190000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261126T190000
DTSTAMP:20261123T235726Z
UID:f0ca45bec178516939d61c7cd35e@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:A targeting system and a forensic investigation both begin fro
 m incomplete information. Each one has its own way of inhabiting those gap
 s. Take\, for example\, an image recognition model. It first learns from t
 housands of images in which a human has annotated what should be picked ou
 t\, and then it confronts a world that does not always lend itself to bein
 g recognised. A forensic investigation reconstructs an event from fragment
 s that arrive unevenly\, each incomplete in its own way\, and layers them 
 so that each can make sense of the gaps the others leave. Júlia Nueno's 
 talk follows one of these models\, developed with Forensic Architecture\,
  to map tents in satellite imagery and read the displace\nCategory: Multi
 disciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule
 /openlab-2026-when-machine-doubts-talk-julia-nueno
LOCATION:Nave Una\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/openlab-2026-when-machine-d
 oubts-talk-julia-nueno
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
