BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fonsi López — Madrid
DTSTART;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261127T200000
DTEND;TZID="UTC+01:00":20261128T220000
DTSTAMP:20261123T235726Z
UID:21fbd35545e99b0aa4f611021ed3@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Multidisciplinary\,Madrid\,Spain
DESCRIPTION:Apex Timing is a contemporary dance piece for five dancers tha
 t reflects on today's culture of constant productivity\, where producing h
 as ceased to be an action and has become a form of identity. This continuo
 us motion generates a state of permanent pressure in which an individual
 ’s worth is measured by their ability to keep up the pace or meet demand
 . “Produce. Perform. Respond. Anticipate. Adapt. Stay available. Be effi
 cient. Make the most of your time. Create. Monetize. Promote yourself. Dis
 cipline your body. Control your emotions. Outdo yourself. Do more. Do it f
 aster. Don’t stop. Don’t get distracted. Don’t let up. Keep going. W
 e were taught that freedom meant choosing—choosing better\, \nCategory: 
 Multidisciplinary\nOriginal listing: https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/sch
 edule/fonsi-lopez
LOCATION:Nave 16.1\, Plaza de Legazpi\, 8\, Madrid\, 28045
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.mataderomadrid.org/en/schedule/fonsi-lopez
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:europe
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:matadero-madrid
END:VEVENT
