DESCRIPTION:The Public Diplomacy Council of America's December First Monda
 y Forum will honor Atlanta and Boston\, the recipients of the Council's sp
 ecial Sports Diplomacy Award. Prof. Jay Wang of the University of Southern
  California will keynote the event\, which will also include remarks by re
 presentatives of the two award recipients. Following the conclusion of the
  successful FIFA World Cup competition in the United States\, PDCA announc
 ed in July that it would present a special award to recognize the most we
 lcoming 2026 U.S. FIFA World Cup host city/cities or community/communities
  with a special one-time award. The award was conceived by PDCA's Awards C
 ommittee in recognition of the extraordinary effor\nCategory: Lectures & S
