 eachtree Road United Methodist Church in Atlanta. Founded in Atlanta in 20
 09\, the Georgia Boy Choir has developed an international reputation throu
 gh performances\, recordings\, and tours around the world. At home\, its a
 nnual Christmas concerts bring together beautiful choral music\, tradition
