DESCRIPTION:Dominick Pupa\, nightclub sensation and cohost of the hit podc
 ast FixingFamousPeople\, returns to Punchline with Dom We Now Our Gay Appa
 rel. TimeOutNY calls his acclaimed annual skewering of the year that was\,
